**Summary of findings:**
- **csw1 eth0** (`10.0.0.34/30`, CD_WAN_LINK_1 toward r1) is **kernel-level DOWN** — no `UP`/`RUNNING` flags. This is an OS-layer shutdown (`ip link set eth0 down`), not an FRR administrative shutdown (FRR config correctly includes `network 10.0.0.32/30 area 0` with no `shutdown`).
